The chapter structure and learning goals follow the Grade 1–7 student books of the
Amhara National Regional State Education Bureau and the English student books of the
Ministry of Education of Ethiopia, which hold their own copyright.
This licence covers only the original content of AMBKidsJoy (text, activities,
characters, 3D videos, song lyrics and music).

